+    """`validate_process_sign_rule` for SLOT-ordered `(P, ny, nx, n_classes)`
+    arrays bound to `present`: slot `s` is checked against the sign rule
+    of canonical process `present[s]`, raising the same
+    `_raise_sign_violation` message the canonical validator raises. One
+    counted read per non-bidirectional present slot."""
