+    # CW-B29: `mobile_after_pickup` is this step's own new array (neither a
+    # caller array nor any result/receipt field); the line above is its last
+    # read, so its storage is released before the ledger accumulations.
+    # CW-B44: likewise the name `deposition` (the step's own `xp.minimum`
+    # output); when the deposition call kept it as `deposited_mass_by_class_kg`
+    # it stays alive through `deposited` below, otherwise it is released.
+    del mobile_after_pickup, deposition
+
